error[E0547]: 'make' makes an array slice, and the type at 'Byte' is not the type of one
 --> test-code/errors/x64/E0547-make-type-invalid.mu:4:22
  |
2 |
3 | main :: proc() Int ->
4 |     bytes := make([4]Byte, 4)
  |                      ^^^^ not the type of an array slice
5 |     return 0
  |
  = note: 'make' allocates the elements of an array slice, which 'destroy' gives back
  = help: write the type of an array slice, such as '[]Byte'
